{"ref":"BDB, פְּדוּיִם","hw":"פְּדוּיִם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">פְּדוּיִם</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>]<strong>pl.abstr. ransom</strong>;—so read perhaps <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:49\" href=\"/Numbers.3.49\">Nu 3:49</a> for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">פִּדְיוֹם</span>, Sam. <span dir=\"rtl\">פדוים</span>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְדוּיֵי</span> v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:48\" href=\"/Numbers.3.48\">48</a>; for other poss. cases v. <strong>Qal</strong> Pt. pass.","next":"BDB, פָּדוֹן","prev":"BDB, פָּדָה"}